From: Luo Jie <quic_luoj@quicinc.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:34:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: describe IPQ9574 PPE EDMA and MDIO topology

PPE is the packet process engine on the Qualcomm IPQ platform, which is
connected with the external switch or PHY device via the UNIPHY (PCS).

Add EDMA (Ethernet DMA) device tree node for IPQ9574 to enable ethernet
support.

The MDIO bus master block is used to accessing the MDIO slave device (such
as PHY device), the dedicated MDIO PINs needs to be configured.

Merged from:
  0343-arm64-dts-qcom-Add-IPQ9574-PPE-base-device-node.patch
  0344-arm64-dts-qcom-Add-EDMA-node-for-IPQ9574.patch
  0345-arm64-dts-qcom-Add-IPQ9574-MDIO-device-node.patch

Based on work by:
  Alexandru Gagniuc <mr.nuke.me@gmail.com>
  Luo Jie <quic_luoj@quicinc.com>
  Pavithra R <quic_pavir@quicinc.com>

